# Tenshodo Membership (jeuno 17): the invite trade, straight from available (no fame, no form needed). A level 75
# Warrior at fame level 1 with two Tenshodo Invites and a Chocobo Feather. Ghebi: fame level 1: nil (her script 106
# (4)). Two invites: nil (tradeMatches wants one); an invite and the feather: nil; one invite: 108; a full bag: not completed, the invite kept; 108 again, finished: completed
# (a new invite, the Members Card), the traded invite taken (tradeComplete), no form to take. Silver Owl at Prog 1 (a
# GM: the quest available again and Prog 1) with no form: 151 (1), finished: the form; the form deleted (a GM): 151 (1)
# again (a progressEvent over UseFallback), the form again; no form, Prog 2 (a GM): Silver Owl and Jabbar: nil (their
# scripts). A second char with the form and an invite: 108, finished: completed, the invite and the form taken.
lists LowerJeuno/Ghebi_Damomohe/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Ghebi_Damomohe/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/108 PortBastok/Silver_Owl/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/151
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=17,-0.1,-7.6 job=WAR lvl=75
char form zone=LowerJeuno pos=17,-0.1,-7.6 job=WAR lvl=75
item TenshodoInvite
item TenshodoInvite
item ChocoboFeather
form: keyitem TenshodoApplicationForm
form: item TenshodoInvite
login
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe                  # fame level 1: nil; her script's 106 (4)
finish
trade Ghebi_Damomohe TenshodoInvite x2  # two: nil
trade Ghebi_Damomohe TenshodoInvite x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # an extra item: nil
trade Ghebi_Damomohe TenshodoInvite x1  # 108
fill-inventory
finish                                  # the new invite cannot be given (a full bag): not completed, the invite kept
free-inventory
trade Ghebi_Damomohe TenshodoInvite x1  # 108
finish                                  # completed: a new invite, the Members Card; the traded invite taken
quest Jeuno.TenshodoMembership available # a GM
charvar Quest[3][17]Prog 1              # a GM
warp -97.7,4.6,23.3 PortBastok          # by Silver Owl
trigger Silver_Owl                      # no form, Prog 1: 151 (1)
finish                                  # the form
delkeyitem TenshodoApplicationForm      # a GM
trigger Silver_Owl                      # 151 (1) again (an event would give her script's shop now: the Members Card)
finish                                  # the form again
delkeyitem TenshodoApplicationForm      # a GM
charvar Quest[3][17]Prog 2              # a GM: Prog 2 (no script sets it)
trigger Silver_Owl                      # no form, Prog 2: nil; her script (the Members Card: her shop)
finish-if-event
warp -98.2,-2.3,26 PortBastok           # by Jabbar
trigger Jabbar                          # no form, Prog 2: nil; his script (the Members Card: his shop)
finish-if-event
form: login
form: trade Ghebi_Damomohe TenshodoInvite x1 # the form held, fame level 1: 108
form: finish                            # completed: a new invite, the Members Card; the traded invite taken; the form taken
